[Info]
Name	Quietcrag
Description	A hushed crag with a small cave to call home. Dig out the dormitory and hatchery, find the old watch hall and the workshop, and learn the craft before the first travellers arrive. Build as you like; nothing here ends the game.
Music	Searching_yd.ogg
FightMusic	TheDarkAmulet_MP.ogg
Sandbox	1
SandboxRealm	Quietcrag
SandboxTarget	14000
SandboxBonus	rooms	4	3000	-	Build four rooms
SandboxBonus	creatures	6	3000	-	Gather six fighting creatures
SandboxNext	skirmish/Lanternreach.level
[/Info]

