[Trigger]
Name	hello
Mode	once
Cond	time	3
Action	message	1	Quietcrag, master. A small cave, a few workers and no hurry. Dig east toward the watch hall and let your first creatures come in through the portals.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	guard
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	GuardPost
Action	message	1	An old guard room stands empty here. Claim it and station your creatures where the roads meet.
Action	gold	1	200
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	shop
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Workshop
Action	message	1	A workshop nobody uses. Claim it and your workers will start crafting doors and traps.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	cross
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Crossroads
Action	message	1	Four roads meet at the crossroads. Travellers from the south-east cave will come this way.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	hollow
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Hollow
Action	message	1	A quiet hollow with a pond. A second portal stands at its edge.
Action	gold	1	250
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	walker1
Mode	once
Cond	time	500
Action	message	1	A pair of travellers is coming up the south-east road.
Action	spawn	2	60	45	1	Adventurer:1	Adventurer:1
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	walker2
Mode	once
Cond	time	1300
Action	message	1	Another small group has entered the crag.
Action	spawn	2	60	45	1	Adventurer:1	Elf:1	Adventurer:1
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	walker3
Mode	once
Cond	time	2200
Action	message	1	A larger party is on its way, master.
Action	spawn	2	60	45	1	Knight:1	Elf:1	Adventurer:2	Monk:1
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	hollowWell
Mode	once
Cond	slabs	1	Hollow	claimed	>=	15
Action	message	1	Your claim on the hollow has opened a spring of mana beside the pond. Claim it with a worker and your spells will come faster.
Action	terrain	19	48	19	48	manawell
[/Trigger]
[/Triggers]
